{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fb158f99-9cc7-82cf-9e2a-a4907fa6de93",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T12:51:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Goldberg",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:49:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:49:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. My name is David Goldberg. I am calling about the snow plowing on my street. I am at 43 Washington Street, in the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:49:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 43 Washington. Go ahead, what's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:49:21-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The city plow came through after the storm, the one Sunday into Monday, snow and then rain. It left a wall of snow behind my car. Now it is heavy and icy, and my car is plowed in. It is Thursday. Three days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:49:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that stuff turns to concrete after the rain and then freezes. Ugh. So the car's parked on the street, in front of the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:49:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, in front. The plow pushed everything against it. I dug for one hour yesterday. It is still stuck. The ice is too thick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:49:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Let me write this down. Car plowed in, 43 Washington, ice and packed snow. What are you hoping for, somebody to come clear it, or just some help getting traction?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:50:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly sand. Please. If I can get sand, I can work on it and maybe the tires will hold. Right now it is just slippery, the sidewalk also."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:50:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sand I can do. I'll put in a request for a truck to sand that block. Do you want me to note the plow bank too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:50:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please note it. Sorry, one moment. I am using the voice typing on my phone to write down your name. I just discovered it. Now I use it everywhere, texts, emails, everything. It is very good, except it wrote Kevin as Kelvin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:50:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, Kelvin, that's fine, I've been called worse. It's K-E-V-I-N, Sousa."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:50:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, fixed. Thank you. So, the sand. When will it come?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:50:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd say sometime this afternoon or tomorrow morning, depending on how the route goes. They've been working through the backlog from Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:50:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. This afternoon would be better. I have to go to work, and I cannot, because the car is stuck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:51:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll flag it as a car blocked in so it gets looked at sooner. Is 401-555-0186 the best number if the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:51:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is my cell. That is correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:51:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Request is in. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:51:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you, Kevin. May God bless you and your family."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:51:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, you too. Take care, and good luck with the car."
    }
  ],
